WEBVTT

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.870
Yeah... What?

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.690
Nothing's really changed, but...

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:37.450
Yeah...

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.400
Right.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:42.140
<i>Kazuki...</i>

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.720
Right. That's fine too.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:44.890
Yeah.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.130
It isn't right for me to do something
as improper as this.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.400
Then get out of the way.

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:51.470
Kuriko!

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:54.010
It's not right! It's improper to listen in.

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.700
But weren't you the first one
listening in, Yuna?

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.100
Rin...

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.510
For someone to be calling Kazuki...

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.910
this might be the appearance of a new rival.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:06.580
It can't be...

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:07.950
What?

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.110
You're coming here this Sunday?

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:13.190
I got it. I'll be waiting!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:15.350
Mom is coming too, right, Dad?

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.090
<i>Kazuki's mother and father...</i>

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.500
<i>This Sunday, they're going to...</i>

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:21.230
<i>Come here!</i>

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:25.870
<i>If I can just get Kazuki's parents
to recognize me as his wife...</i>

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.800
<i>Then Kazuki's genes are mine...</i>

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:53.060
We're going home, Kazuki.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:54.960
Wait a second!

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:55.960
I can't wait.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.500
As a newly wedded wife, we have
to get home quickly,

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:02.290
and do this and that, after all!

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.280
Kazuki, hurry!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.310
We don't have to be in such a hurry!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:15.810
Rin.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.920
Rin, you're going home early today.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.660
Don't talk to me, I'm busy.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.160
I'm sorry.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.130
Kazuki!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.870
Apologizing immediately is
one of your bad habits.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.260
I'm sorry.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.830
Kuriko!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:37.970
Oh, be quiet. It's not like I've
acknowledged you as Kazuki's wife.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.440
Hey, your parents are coming, right, Kazuki?

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.450
Why do you know that?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.950
I'll help you do something nice for
your parents, so tell me...

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:48.380
what's their favorite food?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:52.020
Kuriko, what are you saying?!

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:54.590
This has nothing to do with you!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:58.390
"If you want to shoot the general,
first shoot his horse."

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:03.270
In other words, it means if
you want Kazuki's genes,

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:07.300
then get Kazuki's parents to
recognize you as his wife.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.840
Do you understand?

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.340
Don't say things that are uncalled for!

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:20.240
And so, that's why I want you to tell me
what your parents' favorite food is.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.190
What is it?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.100
Umm...

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:27.390
Eel, I guess.

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.090
Eel, huh?

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.660
It's eel?

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.670
What's going on all of the sudden?

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:53.500
Cleaning up the house is one of
the basics of being a wife.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.050
Now, please, eat up.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:02.650
There's so much.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.590
Cooking is a wife's duty, after all!

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.260
But, isn't this a bit too much?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.400
Perhaps I made too much,

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.530
but if we have this much, then...

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.870
in the days to come, even if we become
an extended family, it will be all right!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.290
It will be perfect for living with
your mother and father too!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.850
Who could have possibly foreseen
a development like this?

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:37.060
Kazuki, good work.
I'll massage your shoulders.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.030
Yuna...

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.790
Yuna?!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:48.300
I wonder if Father-in-law's back
is even broader.

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.570
Father-in-law?!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:54.080
Oh, what am I saying?!
Calling him 'Father-in law'...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.700
I'm so embarrassed!

00:05:57.380 --> 00:05:59.510
<i>All that's left is that.</i>

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.720
A person's image is mostly decided
by their first impression.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.530
The most important thing in a first
impression is the smile!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:16.360
Let's give a delightful greeting
with a bright smile.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.530
All right, then, lesson one.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.370
<i>Greeting with a smile...</i>

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:20.140
Nice to meet you. And smile.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:20.890
<i>A smile...</i>
Nice to meet you. And smile.

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.140
Nice to meet you...

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:44.860
For a day to come where this, the Kazetsubaki
aquaculture plant, is actually useful...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:55.630
Oh, how shiny and big these are!
They're wonderful!

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:59.410
They're able to hold their own
against any natural eels.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:04.950
No, these are secretly developed super
aquaculture eels that surpass all others.

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.750
They're black angels full of
boundless energy

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.150
that have never been available
through standard routes.

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:20.090
I'm going to welcome them with a
heavenly flavor made by a genius.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.830
Just you wait, Kazuki.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.260
I've got to wake up...

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.630
Okay, Shikimori, you're late!

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:10.130
<i>Yuna, I wonder why she
went ahead today?</i>

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.680
And so, the heroes of the renaissance

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:17.520
had to write the record of their
journeys themselves.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:20.120
Around this time, there were many foolish...

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.790
er, no, I mean pitiable heroes

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:25.260
that missed their chance to write the record
of their journeys and lost everything.

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:27.900
In other words, it was an era of
suffering for the heroes.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.130
This generation would later be called
the first generation,

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:35.240
and these days, it's like they
are extinct or fossils.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.670
That was intensified with the beginning
of the second generation.

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:42.400
They were successful in creating new types of
magical stones and producing them en masse.

00:08:43.650 --> 00:08:46.940
Okay, Miyama, no shouting during class.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.880
Even if your own characters are all
destroyed, don't make a sound.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:52.550
I'm sorry.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:57.830
Well, there isn't anything as enjoyable as
playing a portable game during class, though.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:00.300
Well, don't do it too much, okay?

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.090
Yes, ma'am...

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.360
<i>Yuna?</i>

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:11.710
Yuna!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.940
What's wrong?
Let's go home together.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.910
I'm sorry. I'm in a hurry today.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:18.840
Yuna...

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:36.870
No...

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:39.100
Someone save me...

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:02.860
No, I can't...

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:03.980
No...

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:07.030
What do I do?

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.290
What should I do?

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:11.060
Yuna!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.830
Yuna?

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.430
Yuna!

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.380
Kazuki?

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:22.670
Yuna! Are you all right?

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:24.180
Kazuki!

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:26.810
Yuna, what in the world is going on?

00:10:29.880 --> 00:10:33.220
Kazuki, I have a request.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.090
What?

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.990
Please make me...

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.960
please make me a woman!

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.520
This is no good!
It isn't good enough!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:13.530
I told you that I wanted you to prepare the
ultimate and supreme eel over rice, didn't I?

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:17.970
Using the eel from our plant and coming up
with a flavor like this is unforgivable!

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:18.970
Young miss...

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:22.170
It'll be impossible to win Kazuki's
parents over with this!

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.140
This is your punishment!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.310
Father... Mother...

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.440
How do you do?

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:37.450
I am currently in a serious
relationship with Kazuki.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:39.920
My name is Rin Kamishiro.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.590
Why you, why you!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.660
Exactly from what mouth are they
saying I should say that?

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:54.530
But the thing that is important
is the first impression.

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.100
There's no time.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.970
We're going to start.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.010
Okay.

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:24.340
No!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.730
Dammit! I lost again!

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:37.300
I can't do it! I can't touch it!

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.440
I'm no good with slimy things!

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:44.720
I did my best and practiced so that
I could get so I could touch them,

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.690
but for the life of me,
I can't touch them.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.660
Why did you try to handle them?

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.790
That is...

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:57.080
I heard that your parents like eel, so...

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:00.790
I thought that I had to become a wife
that could handle eel by tomorrow.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.400
We can just get delivery for
something like that!

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.540
More importantly...

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:05.640
That's no good!

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.510
This will be the first time I meet
your parents, Kazuki.

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:12.310
I want to be sure to welcome them
with my home cooking!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.280
That's a wife's duty!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:19.980
And yet, I'm a failure of a wife, aren't I?

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:23.490
You're going to end up hating me, Kazuki.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:30.130
It's all right, I won't hate you
because of something like that.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:35.530
Really? You won't hate me for
being this way, Kazuki?

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:41.380
When it comes to love or hate, I'd like to
take my time and think about that...

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:42.840
Or something...

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:47.440
If it's not you, Kazuki, then I can't...

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.310
Yuna, why are you going so far?

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.520
Because they're your parents, Kazuki.

00:13:56.720 --> 00:14:01.750
And because you only see them once in a while,
we have to do something nice for them.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.060
That's true, it might be
just as you say, Yuna.

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:07.740
Kazuki...

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.270
I guess I'll try to do something nice
for them once in a while.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.410
Right!

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.810
Kazuki...

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.040
What is it?

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.900
I'm glad that you're a kind person.

00:14:22.050 --> 00:14:23.950
Then let's hurry up and
start the preparations!

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:24.920
Okay!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:33.430
This is!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.030
Incredible! The split broiled eel is fluffy,

00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:39.330
and both the oil's consistency and
the sauce's color are great.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:42.890
It's the ultimate taste, that clings
to the tongue. This is it.

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:47.800
You've got quite the discerning tongue
for someone so young.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.810
You'll be coming with me, won't you?

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:01.990
Father, Mother, it is nice to meet you.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:06.890
I am currently in a pure relationship
with Lord Kazuki.

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:09.360
My name is Rin Kamishiro.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:14.590
I am very glad to make your acquaintance.

00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:17.210
I did it!

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.640
I've finally managed to say it!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:22.410
How about that, Shikimori?
Something like this is nothing!

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.140
You just give your parents my regards!

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:41.860
Let's see...

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:44.560
Yuna?

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:02.080
Yuna, you're going to catch a cold.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.160
Now, hurry!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.600
And with this, the preparations are perfect!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:22.200
Winning over Kazuki's parents will be a snap
with this, the greatest eel over rice.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.500
With the eel power at full blast,
I'll be getting Kazuki's genes too!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:31.810
Nice to meet you, Father... Mother...

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:38.250
I've done it! A perfect smile!

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.490
Kazuki...

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:25.560
Kazuki!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.330
Please wake up, Kazuki!

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:29.900
The time, the time!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:33.170
Oh, it's already noon...

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:34.680
What should we eat?

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:36.040
What are you saying?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:39.180
Isn't this when your father and
mother are arriving?

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:40.880
That's right!

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:44.280
What do we do?! We haven't
gotten anything ready!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.010
We'll figure that out after
we meet up with them!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:53.190
Kazuki! The train station, they're
coming to the train station, right?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.660
We don't have to hurry so much,
it'll be all right.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:58.000
It's not all right!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.490
We worked so hard to show your parents your
devotion and it will be all for nothing!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:04.660
Look! Your buttons are all misaligned.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.170
Right.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.480
Kazuki, we're going to go and
meet your parents together.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.550
Kuriko...

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:17.950
Kazuki is going out with me!

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.720
We're not talking about playing house here!

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:23.490
When it's over, I'll lend him to you
any number of times, so...

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.450
It couldn't be!

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.760
Have you already done it?!

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:30.830
What are you saying?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.530
I can't lend Kazuki to someone
who uses such vulgar words!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.430
It's not like I need your
permission or anything.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:40.810
Kazuki is going out with me!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.440
It looks like you don't get it...

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.540
It looks like you don't understand...

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.270
Cut me a break!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.920
Oh my, everyone is here.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.350
It's so lively. How nice.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.420
Rin?!

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:56.920
Now, Lord Shikimori.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:19:00.630
Are you all r-r-r-r...

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.830
right?

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:03.000
Yeah...

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:07.020
Then today, allow me to greet your
father and your mother.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.580
Yes, hello?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.720
Kazuki?

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.820
This is a telepathic call!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.620
Oh, Dad.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.780
Right, right... yeah.

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:31.430
What could they be speaking about?

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:33.890
What's that? Do I have a girlfriend?

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:37.360
Oh, there you go again.
I don't have one.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.830
What did he say?!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.430
What? Really?

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:43.770
Yeah, I understand.

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:45.540
Then take care.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:47.010
Right, right.

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:50.710
And?

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:55.280
The telepathic call you just got was
from your parents, right?

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:59.250
What did they say?

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.260
Err...

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.720
Yes, yes?

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:04.760
They said that they can't come today.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:08.530
Work has gotten really busy.

00:20:08.530 --> 00:20:10.160
They had to cancel for today.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:16.040
Why you!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:20.500
How much training do you think
I went through?!

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:22.880
I won't forgive you!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:23.840
Rin!

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:28.350
Seriously! How much effort
do you think I went to

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.980
in order to prepare the ultimate
eel over rice for your sake?

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:34.020
I'm sorry.

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:36.490
There's no need to apologize!

00:20:36.490 --> 00:20:38.550
Instead, take responsibility.

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:43.460
Eat the ultimate eel over rice,
and make your genes healthy.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.030
And then give those healthy genes to me.

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:49.170
That's impossible!

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:52.510
Why? I prepared this for your sake!

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.640
Actually I...

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.200
hate eel.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:58.780
What's that all about?

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:02.920
You see, my parents like it, but I, umm...

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.940
have a problem dealing with it. You know?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.750
What?!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:11.890
Then you're the same as me, Kazuki!

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.130
Kazuki and I are together,
Kazuki and I are the same!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.190
We're a couple that resembles
each other, aren't we?

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.540
Don't get all excited by yourselves, you two.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:25.230
No matter what, you're going
to eat it for us!

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.580
That's right.

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:29.540
It's because you control it
that it's a weakness.

00:21:29.540 --> 00:21:32.430
If you toughen yourself with training, then
you'll be able to eat it, no matter what it is.

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:38.340
I'm sorry!

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:42.420
This isn't something that apologizing...

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:43.890
will settle!

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.330
Please forgive me!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:47.330
Kazuki!

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.300
You won't get away!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.530
Take responsibility!

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:50.630
Stop messing around!

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.270
Do you think you'll be able to get away?

00:21:52.270 --> 00:21:53.100
Kazuki!

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.100
Please, save me!

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:56.730
Come back here!

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:30.700
We were found out.

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:34.970
You two are quite the pair.
It's so pathetic I can't bear to watch.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:37.940
But even you didn't follow through, Kuriko.

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.110
Don't say that...

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:44.040
And as that's being said, the next episode
of Maburaho is "We Met"

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:44.950
What?

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:47.450
I have the feeling that a new rival
is going to appear.
